  "_": "PUYO U-SPEAK, vendored unedited. A SEPARATE GAME with its own CSS and its own save key (puyo-uspeak/v1). It runs in an iframe and nothing in it is imported by the game around it. Taken from the upload: index.html, styles/ and src/ — everything the page loads. Left out on purpose: tests/, package-lock.json, .gitignore, README.md, and dist/puyo-uspeak.html (a 1.3MB single-file build of the same code, which would be a second copy of the game to keep in step). To upgrade, replace those three paths and re-run `node client/tests/guests-manifest.mjs --write puyo`.",
